<title>UK: Prudential says no comment on Lloyds Abbey.</title>
<headline>Prudential says no comment on Lloyds Abbey.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Corp Plc declined comment after shares in Lloyds Abbey Life rocketed on speculation that the giant insurer wanted to buy the life company.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't comment on market rumours,&quot; said a spokesman for Prudential.</p>
<p>Dealers said the rumours were fuelled by the fact Prudential, known to be on the hunt for a building society or life insurer, sold its reinsurance business Mercantile &amp; General back to Swiss Re for 1.75 billion stg on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
